{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12227020.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12227020","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12227020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1222702001:0":{"text":"앞에 있는 저 사람, 상록수 학회의 학자 아닌가요?","source_cn":"前面那位不是冬青学会的学者吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B181C8A0C3D037F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1222702002:0":{"text":"뭔가 찾고 있는 것 같아요... 가서 도와주죠!","source_cn":"他好像在找什么东西……我们过去帮帮忙吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52398943D794DF67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12227030.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12227030","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12227030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1222703001:1":{"text":"뭘 찾고 있으세요? 도와드릴까요?","source_cn":"你在找什么呀？需要帮忙吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ABB28B04A41DA86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1222703002:1":{"text":"오, 정말 고맙습니다! 이런 외진 곳에서 이렇게 친절한 분을 만날 줄이야!","source_cn":"噢，太好了！没想到这么偏僻的地界还能遇到好心人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBDB0CEA5AE6BF30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222703003:1":{"text":"보세요, 가방을 너무 오래 메고 다녀서 구멍이 난지도 몰랐어요. 덕분에 가방 속의 골드가 잔뜩 떨어져서 찾는 중이고요.","source_cn":"你们瞧瞧，我这包背了太久，一不注意竟然破了个洞，包里的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84CFCA212DE82E6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222703004:1":{"text":"에휴, 반년 동안이나 모은 골드인데... 만약 다 찾지 못하면 오늘은 <style=\"highlight\">골든 피콕</style>을 낚지 못할 거예요.","source_cn":"唉，这些金币可是我攒了大半年的……要是找不回来，我今天...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C8F12CBB33C6A37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1222703004":{"text":"에휴, 반년 동안이나 모은 골드인데... 만약 다 찾지 못하면 오늘은 <style=\"highlight\">골든 피콕</style>을 낚지 못할 거예요.","source_cn":"唉，这些金币可是我攒了大半年的……要是找不回来，我今天铁定钓不上<style=highlight>黄金孔雀</style>。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C8F12CBB33C6A37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222703005:1":{"text":"...골든 피콕도 모르시나요? 그건 페르세포네와 어깨를 견줄 희귀한 물고기인데요!","source_cn":"……你们连黄金孔雀都不知道？那可是能和冥湾美人齐名的珍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB24B5D9EDDC0A69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222703007:1":{"text":"아니, 페르세포네보다 훨씬 더 귀한 전설의 피쉬킹이라고 할 수 있죠!","source_cn":"不！应该说，它是比冥湾美人更稀奇的、传说中的鱼王！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0166149F73543FA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222703008:1":{"text":"그, 그렇게 대단한가요...","source_cn":"有、有这么夸张吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E618D3233B9BDA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222703009:1":{"text":"하하, 정말 그런지는 낚아봐야 알 수 있겠지만요.","source_cn":"哈哈，事实如何，总得先钓上来才能一探究竟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2C7534B2D062B51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222703010:1":{"text":"어부들이 그러는데 에스페리아에서 골든 피콕을 볼 수 있는 곳은 러스트 항 수역이 유일하다고 해요. 그리고 <style=\"highlight\">해질녘과 밤에만 나타난다고 하죠</style>.","source_cn":"那些老渔夫们说，整个伊索米亚大陆上只有锈锚港这片水域里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F729FAA0E7267B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222703011:1":{"text":"가장 신기한 건 이 물고기는 골드만 먹는다는 점이에요. 그래서 순금으로 만들어진 것처럼 보이죠. 값어치가 어마어마하답니다!","source_cn":"最稀奇的是，据说它只吃金子，所以看起来也像是纯金打造的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44D88FED6991BDE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222703012:1":{"text":"익숙한 이야기인데, 어디선가 들어본 것 같지 않나요...","source_cn":"好熟悉的说法，我们是不是在哪里听说过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BB147F2C4598B94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222703013:1":{"text":"아! 로완의 오리 블레다크 1세 얘기잖아요? 골드를 먹고 황금알을 낳는다는 전설을 가진 오리요!","source_cn":"啊！是罗万的鸭子，布拉达克一世吧？传说中会吃金币产金蛋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56B2E3B383A9559D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222703014:1":{"text":"원앙이야, 치피.","source_cn":"是姝鸯啦，满满。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x736BE0E1CC3C2E57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222703015:1":{"text":"...뭐라고요? 살아있는 원앙을 보신 적이 있나요?!\n이건 조류를 연구하는 동료에게 꼭 알려줘야겠는데요.","source_cn":"……什么，你们见过活的姝鸯？！\\n回头我得转告我那个研...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C72870944CF2EEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1222703015":{"text":"...뭐라고요? 살아있는 원앙을 보신 적이 있나요?!\n이건 조류를 연구하는 동료에게 꼭 알려줘야겠는데요.","source_cn":"……什么，你们见过活的姝鸯？！\\n回头我得转告我那个研究鸟类的同事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C72870944CF2EEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222703016:1":{"text":"...연구를 위해섭니다, 연구요!!","source_cn":"……我是为了研究！研究！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8704DBEE27C21B8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222703017:1":{"text":"제 자랑은 아니지만, 물고기 연구에 관해서는 상록수 학회에서 제가 1등이라 자신할 수 있습니다.","source_cn":"不是我自夸，在研究鱼类这方面，要是我自称第二，冬青学会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15912044FD0F5F48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1222703019:1":{"text":"아, 이런 얘기 할 시간이 없어요. 얼른 떨어뜨린 골드를 찾아야 해요.","source_cn":"哎哟，没空聊这些了。快帮我找找掉出去的金币吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x275273CF7F71CFD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1222703020:1":{"text":"골드 하나를 더 찾으면 골든 피콕을 낚을 확률이 더 높아지니까요!","source_cn":"多一枚金币，就多一分钓上黄金孔雀的可能性！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4FEFF16C5C5F526","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:0:1":{"text":"팔아서 돈 벌려고 낚시를 하는 거야?","source_cn":"你钓鱼是为了卖钱？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD32D4C8F1F0B4405","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"팔아서 돈 벌려고 낚시를 하는 거야?","female":"팔아서 돈 벌려고 낚시를 하는 거야?","variant_male_record_index":"67472","variant_female_record_index":"67473","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1222703018:1":{"text":"어쩔 수 없죠. 학술 연구를 위해서니까요.","source_cn":"没办法，为了学术研究嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF038582EE9B79F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:1:2":{"text":"못 낚으면 손해인 거 아니야?","source_cn":"没钓到岂不是得不偿失？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x01B9E047C3876D79","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"못 낚으면 손해인 거 아니야?","female":"못 낚으면 손해인 거 아니야?","variant_male_record_index":"67474","variant_female_record_index":"67475","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"골든 피콕?","source_cn":"黄金孔雀？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x17DD227C38023771","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"골든 피콕?","female":"골든 피콕?","variant_male_record_index":"67468","variant_female_record_index":"67469","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1222703006:1":{"text":"네! 골드를 미끼로 써야 골든 피콕을 낚을 수 있거든요. 그건 페르세포네와 어깨를 견줄 희귀한 물고기니까요!","source_cn":"是啊，用金币当诱饵才有可能钓上黄金孔雀。它可是能和冥湾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CBF535395F4A4FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"골드로 낚시한 거야?","source_cn":"你要用金币钓鱼？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFF1FE44BD1DC7CDD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"골드로 낚시한 거야?","female":"골드로 낚시한 거야?","variant_male_record_index":"67470","variant_female_record_index":"67471","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:约克逊":{"text":"잭슨","source":"约克逊","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":27,"localized_text_count":26,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12227040.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12227040","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12227040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1222704001:0":{"text":"주변의 골드는 전부 주웠어요. 학자에게 주러 가요!","source_cn":"周围的金币都捡起来了，回去交给那位学者吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE392FE9E3890B5C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12227050.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12227050","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12227050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1222705001:1":{"text":"학자 선생님, 떨어뜨린 골드를 전부 주웠어요!","source_cn":"学者先生，你掉的金币都找回来啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4CC19BE1626F5E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222705002:1":{"text":"후... 다행이네요. 전부 다 있어요. 여러분을 만나서 다행이네요.","source_cn":"呼……还好，一枚金币也没少！万幸遇到了你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x029A0D7B2489C9C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222705003:1":{"text":"이제 <style=\"highlight\">해질녘까지 기다리기만 하면</style> 골드를 사용해서 골든 피콕을 유인할 수 있을 거예요!","source_cn":"接下来只要等到<style=highlight>黄昏降...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C62D7DE33F2475D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222705004:1":{"text":"혹시 관심이 있으면 여기 남아서 지켜보시는 건 어떨까요?","source_cn":"要是你们也感兴趣，不妨留下来一起见证吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBCB500ED258EA0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222705005:1":{"text":"좋아요! 치피도 전설의 피쉬킹을 보고 싶었어요!","source_cn":"好耶——！满满也想见见传说中的鱼王！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17FF893176D6B73C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:约克逊":{"text":"잭슨","source":"约克逊","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12227060.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12227060","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12227060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1222706001:0":{"text":"드디어 해질녘이 되었네요. 잭슨에게 언제 낚시를 시작할지 물어봐요! 피쉬킹이 너무너무 보고 싶어요!","source_cn":"总算等到黄昏了，我们问问约克逊准备什么时候钓鱼吧！满满...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3C2D6F54911D6AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12227070.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12227070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12227070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1222707001:1":{"text":"해가 졌어요! 이렇게 시간이 길게 느껴진 건 또 처음이네요.","source_cn":"黄昏总算降临了！我从来没觉得时间这么漫长过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13B5FFFFB1D76156","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1222707002:1":{"text":"드디어 낚시를 시작하는 건가요? 치피 너무 기대돼요!","source_cn":"终于要开始钓鱼了吗？满满已经迫不及待了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AB11878AD89753E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1222707002":{"text":"드디어 낚시를 시작하는 건가요? 치피 너무 기대돼요!","source_cn":"终于要开始钓鱼了吗？满满已经迫不及待了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AB11878AD89753E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222707003:1":{"text":"괜찮아요! 이번에는 황금으로 물고기 한 마리는 충분히 만들 수 있을 정도로 골드를 많이 모아뒀어요. 이 골드를 미끼로 사용하면 골든 피콕이 도망갈 수 없을 거예요!","source_cn":"不用，放心！我这次准备的金币多得能直接打一条黄金鱼出来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51595352AEE0E28C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222707004:1":{"text":"하지만 골드를 어떻게 미끼로 쓰는 건가요? 곧바로 낚싯바늘에 걸 수는 없잖아요.","source_cn":"可是，你要怎么把金币做成鱼饵呢？它肯定不能直接挂在鱼钩上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79799CBD674EE323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222707005:1":{"text":"하하, 잘 보세요!","source_cn":"哈哈，那你们就瞧好了——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CE7E9503411C443","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222707006:1":{"text":"...우와! 골, 골드를 전부 강물에 던진 건가요?!","source_cn":"——哇啊！你……你怎么把所有金币都扔进河里了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9E743083A223ABC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222707007:1":{"text":"이게 바로 “밑밥 뿌리기”라고 하죠. 미끼를 한 번에 잔뜩 던져서 물고기를 유인하는 방법이에요. 골든 피콕에게도 분명 통할 겁니다!","source_cn":"这叫“打窝”——把一大团鱼饵扔进水里，吸引鱼聚集过来。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE0187AA73C133E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222707008:1":{"text":"좋아요. 이제 제 솜씨를 보여 드릴 때군요. 조금만 기다리면 물고기가 낚일 거예요!","source_cn":"好了，接下来就是我一展身手的时候了！你们就耐心等待鱼儿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE41721A46DF68237","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1222707009:1":{"text":"날이 어두워졌지만, 잭슨의 낚싯대에는 아무런 반응이 없었다.","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD04108B9AAF0FC3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222707010:1":{"text":"이상하네... 왜 골든 피콕이 나타나질 않지...","source_cn":"真奇怪……黄金孔雀怎么还没出现……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FE48590CACAA1E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222707011:1":{"text":"“전설의 피쉬킹”이라면 그렇게 쉽게 낚일 리 없잖아요. 조금만 더 기다려봐요!","source_cn":"既然是“传说中的鱼王”，肯定不会那么容易上钩的。再多一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67E4E439CCB8AC81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222707012:1":{"text":"에휴, 그것도 그래요... 이렇게 쉽게 낚일 거라면 제가 굳이...","source_cn":"唉，说的也是……如果那么容易就钓到，我也不用亲自——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x109E5B406A598885","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222707013:1":{"text":"...찌! 찌가 움직였어요! 뭔가 낚인 거예요!","source_cn":"——鱼漂！鱼漂动了！有鱼上钩了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24B43E8C95DE21DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"낚시하는 거 도와줄까?","source_cn":"需要我帮你钓吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAE22749CBDBE7D58","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"낚시하는 거 도와줄까?","female":"낚시하는 거 도와줄까?","variant_male_record_index":"67476","variant_female_record_index":"67477","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:约克逊":{"text":"잭슨","source":"约克逊","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":4}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12227090.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12227090","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12227090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1222709001:1":{"text":"황금빛 자태, 우아한 몸놀림, 그리고 선명한 푸른색 꼬리... 게다가 이렇게 손쉽게 낚싯바늘에서 벗어나다니! 분명 전설 속의 골든 피콕이 맞을 거예요!","source_cn":"金黄的鱼影，婀娜的身姿，再加上尾巴那抹鲜亮的绿色，还能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72CAF8B29D721E40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1222709002:1":{"text":"상상한 것보다 훨씬 크고 화려해요... 이래서 러스트 항의 부자들이 그렇게 열광했나 봐요!","source_cn":"它比我想象的更巨大，也更华丽……难怪锈锚港的有钱人都对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE4684C59B3D5F65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222709003:1":{"text":"윽, 전혀 실망하는 눈치가 아니네요...","source_cn":"呃，你好像一点也不失望的样子呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x237A2AE4B04186FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222709004:1":{"text":"왜 실망해야 하죠? 골든 피콕이 나타났다는 것만으로도 제 방법이 틀리지 않았다는 거잖아요! 언젠가는 분명히 낚을 수 있을 거라고요!","source_cn":"为什么要失望？既然黄金孔雀出现了，那就说明我的方法没错...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A72DB7B624ED1C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222709005:1":{"text":"여러분, 만약 나중에 골든 피콕의 흔적을 발견하면 꼭 저에게도 알려주세요! 제 연구 보고서가 거기에 달려 있거든요!","source_cn":"几位，如果你们以后发现了黄金孔雀的踪迹，也记得告诉我一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1D74C82FC15BCF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222709006:1":{"text":"걱정 마세요. 우리가 확실히 기억할게요!","source_cn":"放心吧，我们一定会记得的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x185F429322451E26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:约克逊":{"text":"잭슨","source":"约克逊","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/timeline/timeline_story/1201022522.json":{"asset_key":"timeline/timeline_story_1201022522","episode":"timeline","category":"timeline_story","story_id":"1201022522","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:1:1222708001:":{"text":"...으악! 이 녀석 힘이 너무 세잖아!","source_cn":"——哎哟！这鱼力气也太大了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B9517C9C6780624","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:1:1222708002:":{"text":"마스터, 수면 아래에 물고기 그림자가 보여요!","source_cn":"主人，快看水面下的鱼影！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB7DE810608F30956","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 수면 아래에 물고기 그림자가 보여요!","female":"마스터, 수면 아래에 물고기 그림자가 보여요!","variant_male_record_index":"139997","variant_female_record_index":"139998","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:1:1222708003:":{"text":"골든 피콕...!","source_cn":"黄金孔雀……！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCC1D9E2411C030C7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"골든 피콕...!","female":"골든 피콕...!","variant_male_record_index":"139999","variant_female_record_index":"140000","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:约克逊":{"text":"잭슨","source":"约克逊","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:主角":{"text":"주인공","source":"主角","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}}}}